pkg:Evidence_v1_39_0 a quality:Evidence, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Gate transcript for code-abundance-rdodi v1.39.0 (STORY-8 regression suite rewritten; real Blueprint domain model)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "MINOR: two real pieces of work. (1) STORY-8's highest-risk piece: rewrote the 13 genuinely-failing entries of the real REGRESSION_QUESTIONS suite with content about this corpus's own real principles, each individually verified via real Playwright execution against fusedCorpusAnswer before being written in; re-ran the complete suite after assembly, 24/24 passing, 0 console errors. Confirmed retrieveContext's own 'LCW principles' reference was already dead code (gated behind an empty COMPANY_DATA.companies), not a live bug. (2) A real, substantial new BRSF requirement (domain-modeling-enforcement, newly accepted) required declaring a Blueprint and sweeping a real domain entity's full life cycle -- identified Principle as this product's genuine first-class entity, swept all 4 real life-cycle stages honestly: Creation and ActiveUse genuinely covered by real existing work, Suspension/Exception and Termination genuinely absent and recorded as real BlueprintGap individuals with honest reasons rather than invented coverage. Also resolved closedAtCommit using the real, now-known pushed commit hash. Re-verified: pipeline order PASS, register back to CONFORMANT (0 violations) after both fixes."@en ;
    pub:transcriptSHA256 "88dfc1f62de44dff36966ac9dcaca114074c0390df977bf98d412237b84bb885"^^xsd:string .
